    <visualElement><elementName>Text</elementName><elementAttributes><entry><string>Description</string><string>P41 Terminal output (UART) - Digital task
The busy logic: a 3-bit down counter loaded with 4 when a write is accepted.
Allowed parts: gates + multiplexer/decoder parts + flip-flops
Do not rename, move or delete the input and output pins.</string></entry></elementAttributes><pos x="100" y="40"/></visualElement>
